BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Dadrock: Brenden MC vs Dance DJ Club Night!! Craft & local beverages for purchase as well!\n🎧 DADROCK: Brenden MC vs Dance! 🎧\nThis one’s for the heads and the dance floor.\nJoin us at The Passenger for a club night packed with glitch\, bass\, breaks\, house\, and techno as Brenden MC and Dance! go back-to-back. These two have been rocking underground scenes across multiple states since the late ’90s—expect deep cuts\, heavy grooves\, and the occasional “wait… I know that sample 👀” moment.\n🍸 Eclectic cocktails\n🍺 Local craft beer & liquor\n🍽️ Snacks late\, full dinner menu early\nCome early for dinner\, stay late for the beats\, and let the night take off.\nNo frills—just good music\, good drinks\, and a packed dance floor. ✨🕺\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/dad-rock-club-night--the-passenger-restaurant
DTEND:20260301T080000Z
LOCATION:The Passenger
DTSTART:20260301T040000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Rock] dad rock club night @ the passenger restaurant
UID:70ea9944-49df-4b5d-9823-b37f6e74e79f@70ea.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sing-A-Long of Old School Hymns mixed in with Cheesy Love Songs from all decades! Sing Like No One's Listening! General Admission $ 10. Limited Vip Table Options. Tickets in web link or search "Beer and Hymns Cheesy Love Songs" in EventBrite.\nBeer and Hymns is a sing-along event! Come sing your favorite hymns and pop hits from every decade—with voices strong and glasses raised!\nAbout Beer and Hymns Northern Colorado:Music is good for the soul! Beer and Hymns is a casual gathering for all people who love the idea of singing old-school songs of hope mixed with favorite pop tunes—all while enjoying quality craft beer (or soda\, if that’s your thing). Join us and “Sing Like No One's Listening!”\nYou can bring your own food to this event: Your favorite\, pizza\, burgers etc. or even just snacks. ALL BEVERAGES must be purchased from our host Bootstrap Brewing.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/beer-and-hymns-cheesy-love-songs-edition
DTEND:20260216T030000Z
LOCATION:Bootstrap Brewing
DTSTART:20260216T010000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [R&B] Beer and Hymns "Cheesy Love Songs" Edition!
UID:d6ef5679-73a0-428d-9859-1eba13fafd57@d6ef.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Discovery Days is an early childhood program that encourages children ages 2 to 6 and their caregivers to have fun together through educational\, hands-on art\, music\, and movement activities. When you attend Discovery Days at the Longmont Museum with your child\, you will help them cultivate important school-readiness skills\, such as language development\, attention\, concentration\, fine motor skills\, emotional regulation\, and play and social abilities.\nOccurs weekly on Tuesdays Jan. 13-May 5\, 2026. Three 45 minute-1 hour sessions available: 9:15am\, 10:45am\, and 1pm.\nAttend a session that fits your schedule\, no registration needed. Learn more online and explore weekly themes at https://longmontcolorado.gov/museum/education/discovery-days/ or by calling 303-651-8374.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/discovery-days-music-and-movement-with-ms-ragen-5
DTEND:20260217T210000Z
LOCATION:Longmont Museum
DTSTART:20260217T161500Z
SUMMARY:🎵 Discovery Days: Music & Movement with Ms. Ragen
UID:6fd4c6ff-0199-43c1-a8fe-53cfb87a9c74@6fd4.org
END:VEVENT
