DESCRIPTION:Grab your ticket\nand head downtown for a day and night of what Longmont does best - live local music\, unique venues\, good vibes\, and community spirit! Presented by Flatirons Bank.\nWith 58 performances at 16 venues throughout Downtown Longmont\, you don’t want to miss out on this day of fun and live music Downtown! We're so excited to bring our 2026 headliner Madeline Hawthorne to the WWMS! Full performance lineup and schedule are available on our website. This year's lineup won't disappoint\, and you don't want to miss out!\nGet your tickets before they sell out!\nFind all the information at the\nWinter Walkabout webpage\nHuge THANK YOU to all of our fantastic sponsors who make this event possible:\nThe Longmont Downtown Development Authority\, Longmont Creative District\, SouthState Bank\, Audio Curations\, 105.5 The Colorado Sound\, and all of our venues. We couldn't do this without you!\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/winter-walkabout-music-showcase
